OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Fcoastal shower will remain along
OL,7,Fnorthern coasts. Otherwise, dry with
OL,8,Fclear spells under which temperatures
OL,9,Fwill sharply fall. Fog will start to
OL,10,Fdevelop this evening, becoming
OL,11,Fextensive and dense by dawn. Cold with
OL,12,Fa touch of frost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FMorning fog will be dense and
OL,15,Fpotentially disruptive, inland.
OL,16,FPleasant autumnal sunshine will
OL,17,Fgradually break through by lunchtime.
OL,18,FStill rather chilly, especially along
OL,19,Fa breezy south coast in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
