OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fcold, foggy start for some on Monday,
OL,7,Fwith dimmed sunshine. Cloudy and windy
OL,8,Fwith spells of rain during Tuesday and
OL,9,FWednesday, but temperatures will be
OL,10,Fmilder than previous days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
